{"about_the_game":"Instead of wielding sword and shield, you will fly a <i>sentinel 001</i> through mysterious, randomly generated space dungeons. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032570/extras/39733efdfc312274e3d00ffd1c2e8398.poster.avif?t=1553770483\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032570/extras/39733efdfc312274e3d00ffd1c2e8398.webm?t=1553770483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032570/extras/39733efdfc312274e3d00ffd1c2e8398.mp4?t=1553770483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Repair and pilot 8 space vessels<br></li><li>Explore 7 alien dungeons<br></li><li>Collect and unlock over 100 relics that change how you play<br></li><li>Wield 12 unique weapons<br></li><li>Navigate puzzle rooms, asteroid fields, and booby-trapped space stations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032570/extras/14a83aa1ed2c90e3cf75e9dbe52f1eeb.poster.avif?t=1553770483\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032570/extras/14a83aa1ed2c90e3cf75e9dbe52f1eeb.webm?t=1553770483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1032570/extras/14a83aa1ed2c90e3cf75e9dbe52f1eeb.mp4?t=1553770483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Procedural Level Generation</i>: Every run is unique with levels randomly assembling from a pool of 50+ hexagons. Each floor contains a combination of combat, shop, puzzle, quest, and boss rooms.<br></li><li><i>Randomized Item Drops</i>: With over 150 items to discover, the player can customize their ship however they like. Every level contains a random distribution of firearms, power-ups, and robotic allies. Synergies are waiting to be built. <br></li><li><i>Permanent Death</i>: There is no mercy for those who crash-land. Death in the dungeon means restarting the first floor with no items. <br></li><li><i>Inter-Run Progression</i>: Although death is permanent, a persistent resource allows the player to unlock new ships without hitting defined checkpoints. Defeating each of the 7 levels unlocks a variety of new game elements, along with that dungeon\u2019s marquee faction core.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b5e6e9b438b274b344b3e043f2203fd6e0ce9ddc.jpg","localized_name":"Extra Payload","name":"Extra Payload","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1032570/b5e6e9b438b274b344b3e043f2203fd6e0ce9ddc.jpg"},{"icon":"2432fb62f3affa46c91a65fa611f076e6d1d10c5.jpg","localized_name":"Saw Track","name":"Saw Track","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1032570/2432fb62f3affa46c91a65fa611f076e6d1d10c5.jpg"},{"icon":"4e36a07f4b6a721b98388ad716723f0b45600ec7.jpg","localized_name":"Ram Jets","name":"Ram Jets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1032570/4e36a07f4b6a721b98388ad716723f0b45600ec7.jpg"},{"icon":"c1877381c3297712fdff17bf19f37e45fec87011.jpg","localized_name":"Bomb Shot","name":"Bomb Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1032570/c1877381c3297712fdff17bf19f37e45fec87011.jpg"},{"icon":"18d3e6866fc943a6bf4e340d58f36ef8b36cad79.jpg","localized_name":"Explosive Rounds","name":"Explosive Rounds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1032570/18d3e6866fc943a6bf4e340d58f36ef8b36cad79.jpg"},{"icon":"8891752d706494e7ae9a392508b71218a69319be.jpg","localized_name":"Iron Bumper","name":"Iron Bumper","p